==Malay==
{{wikipedia|lang=ms}}

===Etymology===
Uncertain. Some sources claim it was named after "{{w|Seri Menanti}}" (place of waiting), which is also the name of Negeri Sembilan's royal capital. Others claim that this city was named after "Kampung Serembang", with "serembang" referring to a type of tree.

